  - The witch rains down blue fire from above.
  - The witch surrounds Natsuki with bolts of frost.
  - The witch fires splitting ice spikes at Natsuki.
  - The witch drags multi-colored fire toward Natsuki.
  - The witch launches beams of lightning and fireballs at Natsuki.
